#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/regiments-of-renown.adoc:65
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/skaven.adoc:76
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/tomb-kings.adoc:76
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/vampire-counts.adoc:76
